WEBVTT - Harbor Voices

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
<v.loud Mara Lind>Harbor Voices is on the pilot boat this morning.
<v Henrik>And it is, I should say, extremely early.

00:06.000 --> 00:14.500 line:0
<v Mara Lind>Henrik has brought in ships for twenty-six years &amp; has never &lt;once&gt; been late.

NOTE the next cue is a sound note

00:14.500 --> 00:16.000
(engine starts)

intro-ad
00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
<v Mara Lind>Harbor Voices is presented by the Grey Point Chandlery. Visit greypoint.com for rope, paint and advice.

00:24.000 --> 00:33.000
<v Henrik>We meet the ship three miles out. I climb a rope ladder up the side, which is the part people ask about.

01:02:03.000 --> 01:02:10.000
<v Henrik>An hour later we are alongside, and I have a second breakfast.
